			title: "Arrival in Mesetara"
			icon: "cobblemon:poke_ball"
			subtitle: "Meet Professor Aspen and claim your native starter."
			description: [
				"&6Welcome to the Mesetara Region!&r"
				""
				"You've finally left the hustle and bustle of Unova behind. Out here, the sun-baked red dirt roads lead to unexplored ruins, towering pines, and high-altitude deserts."
				""
				"As Professor Aspen noted, your father taught you the trade of engineering. You will need those skills—out on the frontier, you must forge your own tools and automate your own survival."
				""
				"Because you are new to the region, Professor Aspen has authorized a &dNative Mesetara Starter&r to accompany your standard companion."
				""
				"Harvest your first timber, gather your heavy supply kit, and choose your native partner to begin your legend."
			]
			size: 1.5d
			shape: "hexagon"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
